---
import Layout from '../layout.astro';
const areas=[
{number:'01',title:'Know what’s yours to spend.',body:'A payment hits your account. How much is actually available after taxes, fees and commitments? We help organize your cash flow, set aside reserves and build a spending plan that makes room for your life today.'},
{number:'02',title:'Get ahead of taxes.',body:'NIL deals, salary, endorsements and business income can bring different tax responsibilities. We coordinate with your CPA on income records, tax reserves, estimated payments and relevant state filing questions so taxes belong in the plan throughout the year.'},
{number:'03',title:'Build wealth beyond the next payment.',body:'Money for next month needs a different job than money for ten years from now. We help connect accessible cash, longer-term investments and your goals, with clear explanations of risk, costs and why each decision fits.'},
{number:'04',title:'Put opportunities through a real review.',body:'A brand deal. A friend’s business. A property. An equity offer. We help evaluate the financial commitment, cash needs, concentration and downside, and coordinate with your attorney and agent before you make a decision.'},
{number:'05',title:'Plan for changes in your career.',body:'A transfer, a new contract, an injury or a move can change the financial picture. We help review reserves, debt, insurance needs and ongoing expenses so the plan accounts for more than one version of what happens next.'},
{number:'06',title:'Help people without losing your footing.',body:'Supporting family or giving back can be part of your plan. We help you decide what you want to give, what you can sustain and how to handle requests. If you want us to communicate the boundaries, we can take that conversation off your plate.'}
];
const faq=[
{q:'What does a financial advisor do for college and professional athletes?',a:'A financial advisor can help an athlete connect spending, cash reserves, taxes, investments and future goals into one plan. At RIPL, that also includes evaluating business decisions and setting boundaries around financial requests. We coordinate with your CPA, attorney and agent so you can understand the tradeoffs and make informed decisions.'},
{q:'Is NIL income taxable?',a:'NIL income is generally taxable, including certain products or services received as compensation. Whether taxes are withheld and whether self-employment or estimated tax payments apply depends on how you are paid and the work involved. Keep records of payments, benefits and expenses, and review them with your tax professional.'},
{q:'How much of my NIL or endorsement income should I set aside for taxes?',a:'There is no single percentage that fits every athlete. The amount depends on total income, withholding, payment type, deductible expenses and applicable state taxes. We help coordinate a reserve and payment plan with your CPA and review it when your income changes.'},
{q:'Can RIPL help me say no when friends or family ask for money?',a:'Yes. We can help you establish a giving or lending policy and, with your permission, communicate the boundaries you choose. You decide who is involved and what may be shared. We can explain that a request falls outside your agreed plan without disclosing your account balances.'},
{q:'Can I keep my agent, accountant and attorney?',a:'Yes. We work alongside the professionals you already trust. Your agent handles representation, your attorney handles legal advice and your CPA handles tax preparation and tax advice. RIPL helps connect the financial decisions, identify questions and coordinate the plan.'},
{q:'Do I need a big professional contract before talking with RIPL?',a:'A professional contract is not the only reason to get organized. NIL income, endorsement payments or new financial responsibilities can also create decisions worth discussing. Start with your situation. We will explain the services, fees and whether there is a fit before you decide to work with us.'}
];
---
<Layout title="Financial Planning for College & Professional Athletes | RIPL Wealth" description="A financial partner for college and professional athletes. Organize NIL income, taxes, spending, investments, business decisions and money requests." faq={faq}>
<section class="hero athlete-hero"><div class="wrap athlete-hero-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">COLLEGE &amp; PROFESSIONAL ATHLETES</div><h1>Your career is taking off.<br/><span class="athlete-gold">Give your money a game plan.</span></h1><p class="lead">Training. Travel. Classes. Contracts. You already have a lot on your plate. Your financial life deserves a capable partner who can help you connect the pieces.</p><p>From your first NIL deal to a professional contract, we help organize what’s coming in, what’s going out and what you want it all to make possible.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn athlete-primary" href="/contact/">Start the Conversation</a><a class="text-link athlete-link" href="#athlete-support">See How We Help ↓</a></div><p class="small">Your money. Your decisions. A team in your corner.</p></div><aside class="athlete-priorities" aria-label="Questions we can help you answer"><div class="eyebrow">LET’S GET THE IMPORTANT THINGS CLEAR.</div><ul><li>What can I actually spend?</li><li>What do I need to set aside?</li><li>How do I make this money last?</li><li>Who can help me sort through the requests?</li></ul><p>You don’t have to have it figured out before we talk.</p></aside></div></section>
<section class="section athlete-intro"><div class="wrap split"><div><div class="eyebrow">MORE SUPPORT. LESS MENTAL CLUTTER.</div><h2>You can be great at your sport<br/><span class="athlete-gold">and still be new to this.</span></h2></div><div><p class="lead">There’s a difference between earning money and having a system for it.</p><p>New income can bring decisions you’ve never had to make before. A bigger balance. More paperwork. People with ideas for your money. People who need your help. You deserve somewhere to bring those questions without a lecture.</p><p>We’ll explain your options in plain language, help you build a plan and stay involved as things change. You keep the final say. We help make sure you understand what you’re saying yes to.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section questions" id="athlete-support"><div class="wrap"><div class="athlete-section-head"><div class="eyebrow">YOUR WHOLE FINANCIAL LIFE</div><h2>More than an investment account.<br/><span class="athlete-gold">A partner for the decisions around it.</span></h2><p class="lead">Athlete financial planning connects your income, spending, tax obligations, investments and future goals. We help put those decisions in one place, alongside the people you already trust.</p></div><div class="athlete-service-grid">{areas.map(area=><article><span class="athlete-number" aria-hidden="true">{area.number}</span><h3>{area.title}</h3><p>{area.body}</p></article>)}</div><p class="small athlete-scope">Tax filing, legal advice and contract representation stay with the appropriate professionals. We help coordinate the financial picture with them.</p></div></section>
<section class="section dark athlete-boundaries"><div class="wrap split"><div><div class="eyebrow">YOU CAN BE GENEROUS AND HAVE BOUNDARIES.</div><h2>Let us be<br/><span class="athlete-gold">the “bad guy.”</span></h2><p class="lead">You shouldn’t have to turn every hangout or family conversation into a decision about money.</p></div><div><p>You may want to help the people who helped you get here. That matters. So does keeping your own financial life on track.</p><p>We can help you create a clear plan for gifts, family support and requests for loans. Then, if you want, send the requests to us. With your permission, we’ll help handle the conversation and explain when a request falls outside the boundaries you’ve chosen.</p><div class="athlete-script"><div class="eyebrow">A LINE YOU CAN USE</div><p>“I run financial requests through RIPL. Let me connect you with them.”</p></div><p>We can be the person who says, “That’s outside the giving plan we’ve agreed on.” You decide the boundaries and what can be shared. Your financial details stay out of that conversation.</p><a class="btn athlete-primary" href="/contact/">Start the Conversation</a></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap split"><div><div class="eyebrow">ENJOY TODAY. BUILD YOUR OPTIONS.</div><h2>Your next chapter<br/><span class="athlete-gold">should belong to you.</span></h2></div><div><p class="lead">A good financial plan makes room for the life you want to live now and the choices you want later.</p><p>Maybe that’s a place of your own. Helping your parents. Starting a business. Continuing your education. Or having enough flexibility to choose what comes after your playing career.</p><p>We start there. Then we work backward: what needs to stay available, what can be invested for longer and what commitments make sense. The goal is to turn this opportunity into options you can use.</p><div class="athlete-paths"><article><h3>College &amp; NIL</h3><p>Organize new payments and expenses, coordinate taxes and keep your school’s compliance staff involved in eligibility and reporting questions.</p></article><article><h3>Professional sports</h3><p>Connect salary, bonuses, endorsements and recurring commitments with a plan for variable income and life beyond the current contract.</p></article></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section athlete-process"><div class="wrap"><div class="athlete-section-head"><div class="eyebrow">START SIMPLE</div><h2>You don’t need another complicated project.</h2><p class="lead">We help make the next steps clear.</p></div><ol class="athlete-steps"><li><h3>Tell us what’s happening.</h3><p>What’s coming in? What feels confusing? What decision is in front of you? Start with the short version.</p></li><li><h3>Get the picture organized.</h3><p>We identify the accounts, commitments, deadlines and professionals involved. Together, we decide what deserves attention first.</p></li><li><h3>Build a plan you understand.</h3><p>Clear priorities for spending, taxes, saving and investing. Agreed boundaries. A process for reviewing new decisions as your life changes.</p></li></ol><p>Before you decide to work with us, we’ll explain the scope, fees and who is responsible for what. You should understand the relationship as clearly as the plan.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap athlete-faq"><div class="eyebrow">ATHLETE MONEY QUESTIONS</div><h2>The questions are welcome.</h2>{faq.map(item=><article><h3>{item.q}</h3><p>{item.a}</p></article>)}<div class="athlete-resources"><h3>Useful resources</h3><p>For current tax and college eligibility guidance, start with the original sources:</p><ul><li><a href="https://www.irs.gov/businesses/small-businesses-self-employed/name-image-and-likeness-income" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">IRS: Name, image and likeness income</a></li><li><a href="https://www.irs.gov/businesses/small-businesses-self-employed/estimated-taxes" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">IRS: Estimated taxes</a></li><li><a href="https://www.ncaa.org/student-athletes/name-image-likeness/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">NCAA: Name, image and likeness resources</a></li></ul><p class="small">Educational information updated October 2026. Your payment terms and personal circumstances determine the advice that fits you.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section dark athlete-closing"><div class="wrap split"><div><div class="eyebrow">MEET YOUR FINANCIAL TEAM</div><h2>Bring your questions.<br/><span class="athlete-gold">We’ll start there.</span></h2><p class="lead">A new deal, a big decision or just the feeling that you need to get organized. You don’t need a polished presentation.</p><a class="btn athlete-primary" href="/contact/">Start the Conversation</a></div><div class="athlete-advisors"><article><img src="/images/chase-team-office.png" alt="Chase Bellefeuille, Founder of RIPL" loading="lazy" width="1024" height="1280"/><h3>Chase Bellefeuille</h3><p>Founder</p><a class="text-link" href="/team/chase-bellefeuille/">Learn More About Chase →</a></article><article><img src="/images/adam-team-office.png" alt="Adam Kasick, Wealth Manager at RIPL" loading="lazy" width="1024" height="1280"/><h3>Adam Kasick</h3><p>Wealth Manager</p><a class="text-link" href="/team/adam-kasick/">Learn More About Adam →</a></article></div></div></section>
</Layout>
